{"title": "BYPASS 响应不落盘", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si -H 'Pragma: no-cache' 'http://localhost/index.html?demo=2'"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: BYPASS"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "带 Pragma 头：读缓存被跳过，响应也不写入"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si 'http://localhost/index.html?demo=2' | grep X-Proxy-Cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: MISS"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "紧随的普通请求 MISS：BYPASS 没落盘的证据"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si 'http://localhost/index.html?demo=2' | grep X-Proxy-Cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: HIT"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
